                        "username": "santoshpuranik"
                    },
                    "message": "Need to figure out a solution to this NOLINT. We could do this over the netlink socket or alternatively use popen() (there is precedence here in OpenBMC, but we may get the same warning?). Alternatively, perhaps use boost?"
                },
