                        "email": "mayank.metha@intel.com",
                        "username": "mmetha"
                    },
                    "message": "I agree with the point here. Additionally for mctpd v2, it would be better to make use of the existing LocalEIDs D\u2011Bus property exposed by the au.com.codeconstruct.MCTP.Network1 interface under au.com.codeconstruct.MCTP1 at the path /au/com/codeconstruct/mctp1/networks/<network id>. \n\nSimilarly, <network id> can also be fetched from path /au/com/codeconstruct/mctp1/interfaces/<interface name>."
                }
